{"title":"Bear","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 10 Bear that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">freeze</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/bear\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/bear?lv=8\">Lv 8 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/bear?lv=9\">Lv 9 <span>5</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/bear?lv=10\">Lv 10 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/bear?lv=11\">Lv 11 <span>3</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/bear?lv=8\" title=\"Pick level 8\"><td><b>8</b></td><td>26</td><td>8.9</td><td>400</td><td class=\"muted\">78 · 12.5 · 1,200</td><td>2</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Orc%20Camp\">Orc Camp</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/bear?lv=9\" title=\"Pick level 9\"><td><b>9</b></td><td>28</td><td>9.5</td><td>450</td><td class=\"muted\">84 · 13.3 · 1,350</td><td>5</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Underleaf\">Underleaf</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/bear?lv=10\" title=\"Pick level 10\"><td><b>10</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>31</td><td>10</td><td>500</td><td class=\"muted\">93 · 14 · 1,500</td><td>2</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/King%20Jordon's%20Tomb\">King Jordon&#39;s Tomb</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/bear\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>11</b></td><td>34</td><td>10.6</td><td>550</td><td class=\"muted\">102 · 14.8 · 1,650</td><td>3</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Underleaf\">Underleaf</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"bear\" data-map-level=\"11\">Show level 11 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 3 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 3 looted corpses, 4 recorded drops, 45 total, 9–18 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bear-meat\" title=\"Bear Meat - in 100% of 3 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 5 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a7b15f04819b91d44f5b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bear Meat</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 3/3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bear-hide\" title=\"Bear Hide - in 67% of 3 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b5fe7fee0b1329cf8742.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bear Hide</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">67% · 2/3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"leather-head\" title=\"Leather Head - in 33% of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/ad0df36ce44572a810c0.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Leather Head</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">33% · 1/3</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Shoddy: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Orc%20Camp\">Orc Camp</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 21 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Underleaf\">Underleaf</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 7 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binx%20Crypt\">Binx Crypt</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Imp%20Tree\">Imp Tree</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 2 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/King%20Jordon's%20Tomb\">King Jordon&#39;s Tomb</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"bear\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/6ea4940d5e77a776b717.webp\" alt=\"Bear\"></div><h3>Bear</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>11</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 10)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Bear</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>34</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>10.6</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>550</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>5.3 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>39 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}